"p9s1","text":"Open the GitHub Pages showcase for the Blender short film, a four-chapter multi-asset story, and a b"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"rowser-native Three.js study."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The film has three beats: reveal the cyan silhouette, let the eye find camera, then lift the relic a"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"bove the plinth. The source scene is `examples/cyclopean-porcelain.blend`; the build script is `scri"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"pts/blender-script-demo.py`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The four story frames are rendered from `scripts/render-case-videos.py`: chrome orbit, memory garden"},{"id":"p11s2","text":", brutalist archive, and cloth robot. The direction data is in `docs/examples/scene-suite.json`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Chapter | Render |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Chrome Orbit |  |\n| Memory Garden |  |\n| Brutalist Archive |  |\n| Cloth Robot |  |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Plugin shape"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`scene_director` is the local-first deterministic tool. `scene_director_v4` is an optional Harness/s"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"erver adapter that defaults to `deepseek-v4-pro` and reads `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` only from the server e"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"nvironment. The runtime `director-toolkit` Skill tells the agent when to direct a Blender, Three.js,"},{"id":"p15s4","text":" Houdini, or C4D brief."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"This repository follows the DSH Profile Bundle shape:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- `cordis.patch.yml` mounts the package;\n- `src/index.js` exports `apply(ctx)` and registers tools;\n"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"- `src/skill.js` registers the Skill through `ctx.skills.register(...)`;\n- no `.codex-plugin` direct"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ory and no file-based Skill folder."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Install into Harness"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"For the optional V4 pass, configure the credential in the Harness/server environment:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Editable playground"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The changeable local editor lives in `playground/`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

